   "frames": 79
  },
  {
   "id": "y11",
   "text": "The speech was short. About *two minutes.*",
   "frames": 99
  },
  {
   "id": "y12",
   "text": "The speaker before him talked for *two hours.*",
   "frames": 108
  },
  {
   "id": "y13",
   "text": "Everett later said Lincoln got closer to the point in *two minutes* than he did in *two hours.*",
   "frames": 205
  },
  {
   "id": "y14",
   "text": "So where did the envelope *come from?*",
   "frames": 85
  },
  {
   "id": "y15",
   "text": "A popular story, written in *1906.*",
   "frames": 115
  },
  {
